WEBVTT

00:09:26.713 --> 00:09:30.063
and --two things-- does it feel 
like a big responsibility

00:09:30.063 --> 00:09:33.583
or is it the coolest job in the world?

00:09:33.583 --> 00:09:35.313
(Laughter)

00:09:36.163 --> 00:09:40.333
I'm not going to tell that my job is cool 
to a Bollywood star like you.

00:09:40.333 --> 00:09:42.183
(Laughter)

00:09:43.313 --> 00:09:47.073
But, yes, it's pretty cool,
I love what I do.

00:09:47.073 --> 00:09:51.353
I get to work with really smart people,
to build great products.

00:09:51.353 --> 00:09:54.383
I would say that leadership at this scale

00:09:54.383 --> 00:09:57.733
is a lot more about managing people
than everything else.

00:09:57.733 --> 00:10:00.483
We have over 70,000 people.